--TEST--
a `///` run is answered where the name it documents is written as a reference, so the declaration's own name answers nothing — hover reads the checker's table and a declaration records no expression there, `rule:ide/the-index-answers-the-cursor`
--FILE--
<?nvs
/// Someone a request is about.
class Us<|>er
{
    public string $name = "";
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->name;
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
none
